<title>USA: Weyerhaeuser increases shr buyback program.</title>
<headline>Weyerhaeuser increases shr buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>FEDERAL WAY, Wash. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weyerhaeuser Co said on Tuesday its board has increased the authorization by an additional one million to a total of 11 million shares to offset shares issued in conjunction with a recent acquisition.</p>
<p>The company also said it has repurchased 9.6 million shares of the 10 million shares of stock authorized for repurchase by the board of directors in April 1995.</p>
<p>Weyerhaeuser is one of the largest integrated forest products companies. Its principal segments are timberlands and wood products.</p>
</text>
